    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d10-a12">

                <pb facs="0112" n="20" xml:id="pg20"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 12.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Aaron Kenig to the Legation.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Hartford, Conn.</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1898-10-12"><hi rendition="#italic">October 12,
                        1898</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Dear Sir</hi>: Please answer what it will be the end
                    of the amount of Money which bin taken away from me, on 20 of December 1897, You
                    did wrote few Months ago, as you expect in few Weeks should be a settlement. I
                    hope you will attent to it at wonce I hope to hear from you as soon as
                    possible.</p>
                <p>This young man David Tager which he was arrested by the aurtris frontear which he
                    was travelling with me he is in U. State already.</p>
                <p>I am very respectfully yours,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">A. Kenig.</hi></signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Received, United States legation, October 25, 1898.</p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
